  "brain_first": "“先确认是谁的态度，再看方向，再看强度。”",
  "sort_order": 1021,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 914
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "attitude, tone, view, opinion；选项可能 positive,",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 915
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "critical, cautious, doubtful, objective,",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 916
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "concerned。",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 917
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 918
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "作者态度 ≠ 文中人物/研究者态度。",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 919
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先确认是谁的态度，再看方向，再看强度。”",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 920
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 文章会引用他人观点，命题人常利用这一点偷换主体。",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 921
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 922
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 圈题干对象：author / researcher / residents / writer。",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 923
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 定位评价性词、转折和结尾判断。",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 924
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 先分正/负/中，再区分细强度。",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 925
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 排除过强词：furious, completely opposed 等，除非文本证据很强。",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 926
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 圈题干人物/时间/地点/段落/核心名词/NOT；定位后在段边写题号；必要时写",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 927
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“证据→选项”。",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 928
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 929
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· cautious = 有保留，不等于 negative",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 930
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· concerned = 担忧某问题，不等于 oppose",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 931
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· objective = 主要陈述证据，明显少评价",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 932
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 主体、方向、强度都对。",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 933
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 两个态度词接近时，回到作者自己的评价句，而不是引用内容。",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 934
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 935
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "作者写：The idea is attractive, but evidence is still limited. 更接近 cautious，而非 supportive/",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 936
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "critical。",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 937
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 938
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 把“被引用专家”的态度当作者态度。",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 939
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 情绪强度过度。",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 940
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 941
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 谁在说？",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 942
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 正负中？",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 943
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 强度合适？",
      "sourcePage": 34,
      "sourceIndex": 944
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： R-L 定位错｜R-P 同义替换错｜R-I 过度推",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 945
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "断｜R-S 范围/程度偷换｜R-N NOT/EXCEPT漏看｜R-M 主旨范围错。",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 946
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 947
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 态度题三问：谁、方向、强度。",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 948
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 950
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. researchers support，author says more evidence needed。作者态度？",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 951
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 作者态度和文中人物态度可以混吗？",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 952
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. concerned 属于纯negative吗？",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 953
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 态度题只数正负词够吗？",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 954
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. “objective”通常意味着？",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 955
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. cautious/doubtful；2. 不可以。；3. 通常是担忧/谨慎，强度不同于critical。；4. 不够，要看谁说、",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 956
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "对什么对象。；5. 以事实/中性说明为主，无明显褒贬。",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 957
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— R7 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“R7”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 958
    }
  ],
